{
    "lesson": 65,
    "title": [
        "Not a baby",
        "不是一个孩子"
    ],
    "content": {
        "sentences": [
            [
                "What are you going to do this evening, Jill?",
                "今晚你打算干什么，吉尔？"
            ],
            [
                "I'm going to meet some friends, Dad.",
                "我打算去看几个朋友，爸爸。"
            ],
            [
                "You mustn't come home late. You must be home at half past ten.",
                "你不准回家太晚，你必须在10点半到家。"
            ],
            [
                "I can't get home so early, Dad!",
                "这么早我到不了家，爸爸！"
            ],
            [
                "Can I have the key to the front door please?",
                "我能带上前门的钥匙吗？"
            ],
            [
                "No, you can't.",
                "不行，你不能带。"
            ],
            [
                "Jill's eighteen years old, Tom. She's not a baby.",
                "吉尔都18岁了，汤姆。她不是小孩子了。"
            ],
            [
                "Give her the key.",
                "把钥匙给她吧。"
            ],
            [
                "She always comes home early.",
                "她总早早回家的。"
            ],
            [
                "Oh, all right!",
                "那么，好吧！"
            ],
            [
                "Here you are. But you mustn't come home after a quarter past eleven. Do you hear?",
                "拿去。但你不能超过11点1刻回家。听见了吗？"
            ],
            [
                "Yes, Dad.",
                "听见了，爸爸。"
            ],
            [
                "Thanks, Mum.",
                "谢谢，妈妈。"
            ],
            [
                "That's all right. Goodbye. Enjoy yourself!",
                "不用谢。再见。好好玩吧！"
            ],
            [
                "We always enjoy ourselves, Mum. Bye-bye.",
                "我们总是玩得很开心的，妈妈。再见。"
            ]
        ]
    },
